{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "v8p16 train-first: add progress distance-field map channel to global observation (B line)",
    "date": "2026-02-24",
    "summary": "Hypothesis: long detours are partly caused by missing global cost-to-go information in the CNN input. v8p16 adds a downsampled progress distance-field map (computed by progress_dist_mode) as a second global-map channel: obs = [10 scalars] + [occ map] + [progress-dist map]. Train+infer under the shielded/hybrid regime; compare against Hybrid A*-MPC on fixed pairs (no goal-tolerance changes).",
    "commands": [
      "conda run -n ros2py310 python train.py --profile v8p16",
      "conda run -n ros2py310 python infer.py --profile v8p16"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Claim regime: shielded/hybrid (do not label as strict-argmax).",
      "Anti-cheating: do NOT change goal_tolerance_m (and do not loosen stop thresholds) for evaluation.",
      "Evaluation fairness: use fixed pairs (rand_pairs_json) + run baseline together to avoid sample drift."
    ]
  },
